  "created": "2021-06-01T11:57:50.555Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Observed in test on the latest open beta (1100). \nIf you figure out that you need to teleport somewhere as the result of getting new data in an OnDeserialization event, and then fire TeleportTo on yourself to go there, you only teleport on the XZ plane, not the Y axis.\nThe current workaround is to wait until the next Update loop (SendCustomEventDelayFrame).",
